# Require review for all CI/security workflow changes, dependency files,
# and governance documents. Single-maintainer project — @yshk-mxim is
# the required reviewer for every path below. Adding a second owner is
# the first thing to do when the maintainer count changes.
/.github/               @yshk-mxim
/pyproject.toml         @yshk-mxim
/requirements.txt       @yshk-mxim
/SECURITY.md            @yshk-mxim
/CHANGELOG.md           @yshk-mxim
/NOTICE                 @yshk-mxim
/LICENSE                @yshk-mxim
# User-facing governance documents. A drive-by PR that rewrites the
# "Why SKIFF" pitch or the contributor onboarding story would shift the
# project's posture without a reviewer checking it against the code.
/README.md              @yshk-mxim
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @yshk-mxim
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @yshk-mxim
# CODEOWNERS covering itself prevents a silent edit from removing any
# of the rules above.
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @yshk-mxim
